    "text": "                    Our modelling finds that heat pumps are the lowest-cost heating and\n                    cooling option for most households, lower than gas-fired heating with air\n                    conditioning (Figure 1).13 Despite heat pumps having higher upfront costs,\n                    their efficiency and the fact that they double as a cooling as well as heating\n                    technology supports their cost competitiveness.",
